Subject: [PATCH 150/158] sbom: Fix IFD and ME license URLs
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The URLs were pointing at wrong license file for IFD and ME.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [Dasharo downstream]
Signed-off-by: Michał Żygowski <michal.zygowski@3mdeb.com>
(cherry picked from commit dc19516f2827567f92096083d7ea15a4264e339d)
---
 src/sbom/intel-ifd.json | 2 +-
 src/sbom/intel-me.json  | 2 +-
 src/sbom/intel-sps.json | 2 +-
 3 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/sbom/intel-ifd.json b/src/sbom/intel-ifd.json
index bc379a96bb..78de21f30d 100644
--- a/src/sbom/intel-ifd.json
+++ b/src/sbom/intel-ifd.json
@@ -15,7 +15,7 @@
   "link": [
     {
       "rel": "license",
-      "href": "https://github.com/Dasharo/dasharo-blobs/blob/main/LICENSE"
+      "href": "https://github.com/Dasharo/dasharo-blobs/blob/main/licenses/pv%20intel%20obl%20software%20license%20agreement%2011.2.2017.pdf"
     }
   ],
   "entity": [
